# **4. Advertising and Monetization**

The App uses **Google AdMob** to show advertisements.
Depending on your region:

* **EEA / UK users** are shown a **GDPR-compliant consent form** via Google’s User Messaging Platform (UMP).
* **iOS users outside EEA/UK** are shown an **IDFA (ATT) permission request**.
* Ads may be *personalized* or *non-personalized* based on your consent.

You may withdraw or change your consent at any time through the App’s privacy settings (if available) or via system settings (iOS/Android).

Relevant Google privacy links:
[https://policies.google.com/privacy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)
[https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites](https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites)

